  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか\r\n食事はちゃんととってるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "まあ、それなりにね\r\n一人暮らしだし外食や宅配に頼ることが多いけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100021/1802001000210020"
  },
  {
    "select": "今は色々選べるからな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000211"
  },
  {
    "select": "ちゃんと食べてるなら\r\nいいんだ",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000212"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "栄養はとれてるか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000213"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210030,
    "label": "1802001000211",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうなのよ。野菜中心の料理とか、\r\nご飯の代わりに豆腐を使ったものもあるからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100021/1802001000210030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "自炊しなくても栄養管理はできるってこと\r\nちゃんとわかってるみたいで、安心したわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100021/1802001000210040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210050,
    "label": "1802001000212",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そんなことまで心配しなくちゃいけないなんて\r\nプロデューサーも大変ね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100021/1802001000210050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それなりに栄養バランスも考えてるから\r\n安心していいわよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100021/1802001000210060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000210070,
    "label": "1802001000213",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "心配しなくても大丈夫よ\r\n外食でも宅配でもヘルシーなメニューはあるんだし",
